  "total_sec": 45.289,
  "total_frames": 1359,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "连咖啡店的 WiFi 输密码？等于把密码写在明信片上寄出去。",
      "audio": "s01.mp3",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 4.629,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 139,
      "dur_sec": 4.629
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "HTTP 就是这张明信片，路上经手的每个人，都看得到内容。",
      "audio": "s02.mp3",
      "start_sec": 4.809,
      "end_sec": 9.664,
      "start_frame": 144,
      "end_frame": 290,
      "dur_sec": 4.855
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "HTTPS，就是把它装进密封信封，再上一把锁。",
      "audio": "s03.mp3",
      "start_sec": 9.844,
      "end_sec": 14.005,
      "start_frame": 295,
      "end_frame": 420,
      "dur_sec": 4.161
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "只有收件人有钥匙，中间的路由器、运营商，全都看不到。",
      "audio": "s04.mp3",
      "start_sec": 14.185,
      "end_sec": 18.62,
      "start_frame": 426,
      "end_frame": 559,
      "dur_sec": 4.435
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "怎么做到的？HTTPS 比 HTTP 多了一层加密。",
      "audio": "s05.mp3",
      "start_sec": 18.8,
      "end_sec": 23.165,
      "start_frame": 564,
      "end_frame": 695,
      "dur_sec": 4.365
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "浏览器和服务器先商量好一把钥匙，数据锁起来，到了对面才解锁。",
      "audio": "s06.mp3",
      "start_sec": 23.345,
      "end_sec": 28.483,
      "start_frame": 700,
      "end_frame": 854,
      "dur_sec": 5.138
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "所以网址前面那把小锁，不是装饰，是你的密码正在被保护。",
      "audio": "s07.mp3",
      "start_sec": 28.663,
      "end_sec": 33.439,
      "start_frame": 860,
      "end_frame": 1003,
      "dur_sec": 4.777
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "对了，自己上线网站记得配一张 HTTPS 证书，免费的就行。",
      "audio": "s08.mp3",
      "start_sec": 33.619,
      "end_sec": 38.669,
      "start_frame": 1009,
      "end_frame": 1160,
      "dur_sec": 5.05
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "面试问 HTTP 和 HTTPS 的区别？讲明信片和信封，比背定义强一百倍。",
      "audio": "s09.mp3",
      "start_sec": 38.849,
      "end_sec": 45.109,
      "start_frame": 1165,
      "end_frame": 1353,
      "dur_sec": 6.26
    }
  ]
